## Import

The resource has no `id` attribute: a component is identified by its full address, so the import
ID has to carry all four segments, `<organization>/<project>/<environment>/<canonical>`:

```shell
terraform import cycloid_component.example my-org/my-project/my-env/my-component
```

Only `organization`, `project`, `environment` and `canonical` are set by the import; every other
attribute is filled in by the refresh that immediately follows.
